9
00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.680
Oh, man.

10
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:49.900
So that was one of the big moments in LSU football history with Y.A.

11
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.660
Tittle losing his pants against Ole Miss.
